scheduling and priority inversion,syllabus Lesson 10; time-sensitive Linux paper,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10a-TS-Linux.md,Priority-based scheduling and priority inversion,labs/lab-22-realtime,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10a-08,concept,5,L10a,Supporting time-sensitive tasks alongside throughput tasks,syllabus Lesson 10; time-sensitive Linux paper,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10a-TS-Linux.md,Supporting time-sensitive tasks alongside throughput tasks,labs/lab-22-realtime,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10a-09,concept,5,L10a,Virtualize everything but time: clock synchronization in VMs,syllabus Lesson 10; time-sensitive Linux paper,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10a-TS-Linux.md,Virtualize everything but time: clock synchronization in VMs,labs/lab-22-realtime,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10b-01,concept,5,L10b,Situation awareness applications,syllabus Lesson 10; PTS paper; Yima,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10b-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md,Situation awareness applications,labs/lab-23-temporal-streams,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10b-02,concept,5,L10b,Programming model challenges for live streams,syllabus Lesson 10; PTS paper; Yima,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10b-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md,Programming model challenges for live streams,labs/lab-23-temporal-streams,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10b-03,concept,5,L10b,PTS programming model: channels and time-indexed items,syllabus Lesson 10; PTS paper; Yima,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10b-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md,PTS programming model: channels and time-indexed items,labs/lab-23-temporal-streams,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10b-04,concept,5,L10b,Time-based get and put,syllabus Lesson 10; PTS paper; Yima,Part-5-Internet-Scale-Real-Time-and-Security/L10b-Persistent-Temporal-Streams.md,Time-based get and put,labs/lab-23-temporal-streams,Practice/Practice-L10.md,todo\r\nL10b-05,concept,5,L1